# cros-libva local patch (0.0.13)

Upstream crates.io release fails to compile against libva >= 2.23.0 (VA API 1.23.0)
due to missing fields in `EncPictureParameterBufferVP9::new()`.

Patches applied (from https://github.com/chromeos/cros-libva/pull/37):

- `build.rs`: emit `libva_1_22_or_higher` and `libva_1_23_or_higher` cfg flags
- `src/buffer/vp9.rs`: gate `seg_id_block_size` and `va_reserved8` for libva 1.23+

Remove this vendored copy and the `[patch.crates-io]` entry in `rust/Cargo.toml`
once upstream merges the fix and publishes a new release.
